<body><p><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">In the TRAIL, you will learn about t</span><span style="margin: 0px;">he </span><span style="margin: 0px;">different pha</span><span style="margin: 0px;">ses</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> of transdisciplinary education. The first phase is about the team and the collaboration within it. The next phase shows how transdisciplinary education is developed. The following phase is abo</span><span style="margin: 0px;">ut </span><span style="margin: 0px;">participat</span><span style="margin: 0px;">ing</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> in the transdisciplinary program and the results you can achieve. In the final phase, questions help you evaluate and look ahead to new challenges.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></body>
